---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="A practical note-taking guide"
  description="A small workflow for turning research into reusable notes without endless browsing."
>
  <section class="section">
    <h1>A practical note-taking guide.</h1>
    <p>This is a short workflow, not a productivity system. It is meant for days when you want to learn something, use it, and move on.</p>
    <p>The goal is not to collect more links. The goal is to leave a trace you can actually reuse.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Workflow</h2>
    <div class="list">
      <div class="list-item card">
        <p style="font-weight:600">Step 1: Pick one goal</p>
        <p style="color:var(--color-ink-muted);margin-top:0.25rem">Write the smallest version of what you want to learn or build. If it fits on one sticky note, it is real.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="list-item card">
        <p style="font-weight:600">Step 2: Collect three useful sources</p>
        <p style="color:var(--color-ink-muted);margin-top:0.25rem">One clear explanation, one example, one source you can cite if someone asks where it came from.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="list-item card">
        <p style="font-weight:600">Step 3: Extract one reusable action</p>
        <p style="color:var(--color-ink-muted);margin-top:0.25rem">Not a summary. An action you would repeat next week. If there is no action, delete the note.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="list-item card">
        <p style="font-weight:600">Step 4: Make it easy to reuse</p>
        <p style="color:var(--color-ink-muted);margin-top:0.25rem">Add a title, one example, one check, and one source link. Later, you will thank yourself.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Examples</h2>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="card card-raised">
        <p style="font-weight:600">Noisy morning</p>
        <p style="color:var(--color-ink-muted);margin-top:0.25rem">Use a 5-minute starter: one drink of water, one task, one notification block. No big plan.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-raised">
        <p style="font-weight:600">Repeated search</p>
        <p style="color:var(--color-ink-muted);margin-top:0.25rem">Save the exact phrase, the best source, and the step you used. Next time, open your note first.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-raised">
        <p style="font-weight:600">Learning in public</p>
        <p style="color:var(--color-ink-muted);margin-top:0.25rem">Share one sentence about what you changed and one result. That is enough to stay accountable.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section callout">
    <p style="color:var(--color-ink);margin:0">If you want, next step is the about page, where this project and its limits are stated plainly.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:0.5rem">
      <a href="/about/" style="font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px">Read the about page -></a>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
